        "original_id": "a7dcd828-7cba-555c-b21d-056264d6e115",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Nabors, Betty Lynn, Andy Griffith, Deputy Barney Fife, Lindsey\n- Roles: Gomer Pyle, Goober Pyle, Thelma Lou\n- Places: Santa Monica, The Horn\n- Productions: The Andy Griffith Show\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Nabors was born on June 12, 1930, and he is a retired American actor, singer, and comedian.\n- Betty Lynn was born on August 29, 1926, and she is a former American actress.\n- Jim Nabors worked at The Horn, a Santa Monica nightclub, before Andy Griffith discovered him.\n- Jim Nabors later joined The Andy Griffith Show and played Gomer Pyle.\n- Betty Lynn is best known for playing Thelma Lou, who was Deputy Barney Fife's girlfriend, on The Andy Griffith Show.\n- Lindsey first read for the role of Gomer Pyle, who was Goober Pyle's cousin, but the part went to actor-singer Jim Nabors.",
